      "text": "Small weather",
      "start": 0.0,
      "duration": 1.7
    },
    {
      "text": "A garden pool holds the blue of the sky and the shade of leaves. Rain passes through the reflection in a field of keyboard characters. As the ripples spread, small flashes of colour catch along their crests.",
      "start": 1.88,
      "duration": 13.8
    },
    {
      "text": "Click or tap to send a ripple across the pool. Turn on Sound for the soft patter of rain, or let the water move in silence.",
      "start": 15.86,
      "duration": 8.95
    },
    {
      "text": "By Brad Necyk, 2026. A living artwork from Cyberdelic OS.",
      "start": 24.99,
